svg)\nWe start with a square model of ![](images/9f/9fcebe90d169f37bbdbf55f9e4ac86ceaf6ea6d573d101f382a12008bb0c5c2a.svg) split *vertically*.\n\n![](images/cc/ccfe0f457342c456200c98cfc46e63bdc1153698282085164eeafae5c2092c45.png)\n\nTo divide ![](images/9a/9ae11798da63cafee6ce5ccf824a7b96f9f7407a4ee445d1431d907c36f5dd1b.svg) by ![](images/db/dbfe30ca4e672459c180bd90f25f84f025162b8ce73260773fb1fbdf39b0a052.svg) we split the above whole into ![](images/6f/6f33d8df0d08ae9bddce540bedf62f46e93e748e4a5b6fd85b1dc626953e44a6.svg) equal parts *horizontally*. Then, we remove any shaded parts that are not in the bottom row.\n\n![](images/79/7940073ba05d3136ee1d465530a60bc3624b7aa06fd7484d30797758a28976d7.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents ![](images/42/42accbcb8cbfd14800ac4a27bc87d5ba529ff4173a91499f32705cd41b0c88b0.svg) of the whole.\n\nTherefore,\n![](images/f1/f14a0f0f9efb98bdfe6cf40f4b1bbb2c88dc20272caaf9d604fcc44bce79d53c.svg)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075052 #edb/ref 1065 8924 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075052 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "5efb47fa-47c0-50c8-9c53-0a64bfc732ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075052 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426174 #edb/ref 1080 "images/2d/2db872fb5fb0fcd14995cd17d624a4d6548f2599f06fa87751c3f523a4343bd3.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426174 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426174 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "13decac2-cb86-55aa-808f-d37c3846c461" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426175 #edb/ref 1080 "4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426175 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426175 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "24789ef8-39e5-5eb7-8a31-b15bbcaa8124" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426176 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{12}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426176 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186426176 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "282af08e-d6ca-5ae5-a8a3-